{"name":"Jagdwurst","hex":"#ffcccb","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[],"entries":[{"title":"Jagdwurst","blocks":[{"text":"Jagdwurst is a German cooked sausage made with finely ground pork sausage meat and coarse chunks of lean pork or pork belly. Some recipes also include beef. The meat is usually seasoned with salt and flavoured with spices such as green peppercorns, mace, ginger and coriander. North German styles of Jagdwurst often contain mustard seeds, and in the south, pistachio pieces are a common ingredient."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a2/Tiroler_Jagdwurst_-_2014-11-29_%283%29.jpg/330px-Tiroler_Jagdwurst_-_2014-11-29_%283%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jagdwurst","wikidata":"Q1640641"}],"images":[],"sounds":{},"pictures":[{"title":"Little sparrow on a pink wall","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/ba/Little_sparrow_on_a_pink_wall.jpg/500px-Little_sparrow_on_a_pink_wall.jpg","ratio":1.5,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Little_sparrow_on_a_pink_wall.jpg","share":0.261875},{"title":"Tiroler Jagdwurst - 2014-11-29 (3)","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a2/Tiroler_Jagdwurst_-_2014-11-29_%283%29.jpg/500px-Tiroler_Jagdwurst_-_2014-11-29_%283%29.jpg","ratio":1.5001259763164525,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Tiroler_Jagdwurst_-_2014-11-29_(3).jpg","share":0.12625},{"title":"Pink 2006","image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/cc/Pink_2006.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","ratio":0.7339449541284404,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Pink_2006.jpg","share":0.10125},{"title":"Jagdwurst EWG - 2014-12-04 (3)","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b1/Jagdwurst_EWG_-_2014-12-04_%283%29.jpg/500px-Jagdwurst_EWG_-_2014-12-04_%283%29.jpg","ratio":1.2872379551